    tools/gen_strings.py generates Strings.g.cs from it, and Strings.fr.resx must
    carry the same keys. Keys are PascalCase and never contain a dot; placeholders
    are {0}, {1}. Plural forms are two keys, ...One and ...Other, chosen by
